From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 10:46:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] android: show progress in the download service notifications
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Align the two download notifications with the HarmonyOS builds of
Mihon and Anikku so that the three apps read alike in the shade:

- content: "<speed text> · <progress>%" with a determinate progress bar
  whenever the service knows the overall progress
- HTTP cache service: progress is weighted by size over the active
  in-process downloads (plain mean when a size is unknown, nothing when
  none reports a progress), and the expanded notification shows the
  "<subject> - <episode>" currently being cached
- BT service: progress comes from TorrentDownloader.Stats.downloadProgress

NotificationDisplayStrategy.Working gains optional progress / detail
fields; the defaults keep the previous single-line notification, so
no strings change.
---
 .../torrent/service/AniTorrentService.kt      |  6 ++++
 .../torrent/service/HttpCacheService.kt       | 34 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../torrent/service/ServiceNotification.kt    | 28 +++++++++++----
 3 files changed, 61 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/shared/app-data/src/androidMain/kotlin/domain/torrent/service/AniTorrentService.kt b/app/shared/app-data/src/androidMain/kotlin/domain/torrent/service/AniTorrentService.kt
